  "methods_narrative": "Module 3 examined true multiome context for HuBMAP donor HBM994.NXZC.854 using SNARE-seq2 Salmon+ArchR+Muon dataset HBM828.GPVG.252. The default teaching path interprets the fitted MOFA model (`multiome_mofa.hdf5`) without requiring the full MuData download. RNA and ATAC modalities occupy the same barcode space when MuData is loaded. Joint structure is summarized with MOFA factors (rna + atac_cbg views). A genome-wide gene bridge uses feature_std_on_mofa_inputs on MOFA inputs (joined by HUGO symbol). Claims about shared latent structure must match the variance table (re-measured in Phase 3). Software: scanpy 1.11.5, anndata 0.12.19.",
